{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2006-common-biology-07","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2006,"subject":"biology","number":7,"points":null,"unitId":"circulation","unitLabel":"순환·혈액","topic":"헤모글로빈·정맥·혈류","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["circulation","neuro","plant"],"stem":"그림은대뇌피질의활성을실시간으로측정할수있는기능성\n자기공명영상(fMRI) 기법을이용하여측두엽의특정부위가단어\n를들려주었을때활성화되는것을보여주고있다. 이기법은신\n경세포활성에의한국소정맥혈액내산화헤모글로빈(HbO2)과\n탈산화헤모글로빈(Hb) 비율의변화를측정함으로써대뇌특정부\n위의활성정도를간접적으로알아낼수있다.\n측두엽활성부위에서나타나는이차적인변화를순서대로표시한\n것은?\nA. 신경세포활성에따른대사요구량의증가\nB. 혈류량의증가\nC. (\n조직으로들어오는동맥혈액내총산소량) 비율의감소\n혈액에서조직으로이동하는산소량\nD. 국소정맥혈액내HbO2/Hb 비율의감소\nE. 국소정맥혈액내HbO2/Hb 비율의증가","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"A →B →C →D →E","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":2,"text":"A →B →D →C →E","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":3,"text":"A →C →D →B →E","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":4,"text":"A →D →B →C →E","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":5,"text":"A →D →C →B →E","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":355,"height":276,"region":0,"bbox":[98.456,121.06,142.0,110.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-common-biology-07/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":287,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,287.46,308.8,114.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-common-biology-07/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":3,"sourceRect":[82.744,151.34,416.5,660.044],"width":333.756,"height":508.704,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[98.456,121.06,142.0,110.4],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.056,287.46,308.8,114.8],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"tex